        Q("What kind of condition is it?", "A vasculitis (inflammation of blood vessels)", ["A bacterial throat infection", "A food allergy", "An inherited heart valve defect"],
          "The cause is still unknown; it’s thought to be an immune reaction to a trigger in susceptible children."),
        Q("Which symptom is required for the classic diagnosis?", "Fever for 5 days or more", ["A rash only", "A cough", "Diarrhoea"],
          "Plus at least 4 of 5 other features."),
